-- 登记: A09 | 语义: 再写同一句 DESC。apply 已经是同值，restore 同样不改几何 | expected_net: unchanged | restore 搭档: 本文件是 attr/desc_same_apply.mac 的 restore
ALPHA LOG "{{LOG_PATH}}" OVER
$P SUITE-ATTR-DESC-SAME-RESTORE-ALIVE
/AIOS-SUITE-EQ-DESC
Q REF
Q NAME
Q DESC
DESC 'AIOS suite desc same'
Q DESC
SAVEWORK 'AIOS suite attr/desc_same restore: EQ-DESC DESC rewritten unchanged'
$P SUITE-ATTR-DESC-SAME-RESTORE-DONE
ALPHA LOG END
